{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve bounded opaque values for custom renderers.** Small values without a `__dict__`, slots, or a listed special case\u2014such as `datetime.date`\u2014are treated as over-budget here, so every lane drops the record before `exporter.render()` can normalize it. This regresses valid content/result transforms. Charge safe opaque leaves by shallow size or add bounded type-specific handling, with a custom-renderer regression test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s7fDg","finding_digest":"45c6b7e59c258cff3290510a9fd3bada9db7088ef5c67825bf6b0070991937b8","finding_id":"arf_v1_ixdlpzm4ewgp6muqkefj7u523k","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.schedule::pre-render-admission-rejection","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exportscheduler.schedule::pre-render-admission-rejection","line":141,"observation_digest":"74960521ae1859891d2842a6ccafb694103dcd31a75a48688373ed314d604d8a","observation_id":"aro_v1_oslakinodbmyshjiiktmzl5wsq","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ixdlpzm4ewgp6muqkefj7u523k","published_at":"2026-09-10T02:50:42Z","review_id":"arr_v1_k4hrjqgchgrlblks6ft3hhim26","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"4bd5e14f415ee5f249d3e4ff6501b023bcf916f7","reviewer":"codex","start_line":141,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_qq2quov7wjwyy34favnchyh44g","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-10T02:50:42Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
